<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-mth T-bill yield rises to 22.01 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-mth T-bill yield rises to 22.01 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.01 percent on Wednesday, up from 21.67 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	   5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received    3,979.20 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allgcated	  3,979.20 million fgrints</p>
<p>    Total issued	     4,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    22.01 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     94.9065 pct</p>
</text>
